{"page":252,"verses":[{"verse_key":"13:19","surah":13,"ayah":19,"ar_uthmani":"۞ أَفَمَن يَعْلَمُ أَنَّمَآ أُنزِلَ إِلَيْكَ مِن رَّبِّكَ ٱلْحَقُّ كَمَنْ هُوَ أَعْمَىٰٓ ۚ إِنَّمَا يَتَذَكَّرُ أُو۟لُوا۟ ٱلْأَلْبَـٰبِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Can someone who knows that the revelation from your Lord is the Truth be equal to someone who is blind? Only those with understanding will take it to heart;","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"۞ أَفَمَن","en_gloss":"Then is (he) who","transliteration":"afaman","verse_key":"13:19"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَعْلَمُ","en_gloss":"knows","transliteration":"yaʿlamu","verse_key":"13:19"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَنَّمَآ","en_gloss":"that which","transliteration":"annamā","verse_key":"13:19"},{"pos":4,"ar":"أُنزِلَ","en_gloss":"has been revealed","transliteration":"unzila","verse_key":"13:19"},{"pos":5,"ar":"إِلَيْكَ","en_gloss":"to you","transliteration":"ilayka","verse_key":"13:19"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"13:19"},{"pos":7,"ar":"رَّبِّكَ","en_gloss":"your Lord","transliteration":"rabbika","verse_key":"13:19"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلْحَقُّ","en_gloss":"(is) the truth","transliteration":"l-ḥaqu","verse_key":"13:19"},{"pos":9,"ar":"كَمَنْ","en_gloss":"like (one) who","transliteration":"kaman","verse_key":"13:19"},{"pos":10,"ar":"هُوَ","en_gloss":"[he]","transliteration":"huwa","verse_key":"13:19"},{"pos":11,"ar":"أَعْمَىٰٓ ۚ","en_gloss":"(is) blind","transliteration":"aʿmā","verse_key":"13:19"},{"pos":12,"ar":"إِنَّمَا","en_gloss":"Only","transliteration":"innamā","verse_key":"13:19"},{"pos":13,"ar":"يَتَذَكَّرُ","en_gloss":"pay heed","transliteration":"yatadhakkaru","verse_key":"13:19"},{"pos":14,"ar":"أُو۟لُوا۟","en_gloss":"men","transliteration":"ulū","verse_key":"13:19"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱلْأَلْبَـٰبِ","en_gloss":"(of) understanding","transliteration":"l-albābi","verse_key":"13:19"},{"pos":16,"ar":"١٩","en_gloss":"(19)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"13:19"}]},{"verse_key":"13:20","surah":13,"ayah":20,"ar_uthman