,"transliteration":"yūṣala","verse_key":"13:21"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَيَخْشَوْنَ","en_gloss":"and fear","transliteration":"wayakhshawna","verse_key":"13:21"},{"pos":10,"ar":"رَبَّهُمْ","en_gloss":"their Lord","transliteration":"rabbahum","verse_key":"13:21"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَيَخَافُونَ","en_gloss":"and are afraid","transliteration":"wayakhāfūna","verse_key":"13:21"},{"pos":12,"ar":"سُوٓءَ","en_gloss":"(of) the evil","transliteration":"sūa","verse_key":"13:21"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلْحِسَابِ","en_gloss":"the account","transliteration":"l-ḥisābi","verse_key":"13:21"},{"pos":14,"ar":"٢١","en_gloss":"(21)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"13:21"}]},{"verse_key":"13:22","surah":13,"ayah":22,"ar_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِينَ صَبَرُوا۟ ٱبْتِغَآءَ وَجْهِ رَبِّهِمْ وَأَقَامُوا۟ ٱلصَّلَوٰةَ وَأَنفَقُوا۟ مِمَّا رَزَقْنَـٰهُمْ سِرًّا وَعَلَانِيَةً وَيَدْرَءُونَ بِٱلْحَسَنَةِ ٱلسَّيِّئَةَ أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ لَهُمْ عُقْبَى ٱلدَّارِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"who remain steadfast through their desire for the face of their Lord; who keep up the prayer; who give secretly and openly from what We have provided for them; who repel evil with good. These will have the reward of the [true] home:","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"And those who","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","verse_key":"13:22"},{"pos":2,"ar":"صَبَرُوا۟","en_gloss":"(are) patient","transliteration":"ṣabarū","verse_key":"13:22"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱبْتِغَآءَ","en_gloss":"seeking","transliteration":"ib'tighāa","verse_key":"13:22"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَجْهِ","en_gloss":"(the) Face","transliteration":"wajhi","verse_key":"13:22"},{"pos":5,"ar":"رَبِّهِمْ","en_gloss":"(of) their Lord","transliteration":"rabbihim","verse_key":"13:22"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَأَقَامُوا۟","en_gloss":"and establish","transliteration":"wa-aqāmū","verse_key":"13:22"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلصَّلَوٰةَ","en_gloss":"the prayer","transliteration":"l-ṣalata","verse_key":"13:22"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَأَنفَقُوا۟","en_gloss":"and spend","transliteration":"wa-anfaqū","verse_key":"1